{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mine, mine, mine ...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've ventured into the depths of the caves with one goal\u2014getting rich. Starting with nothing, you must race against time to meet your daily objectives by acquiring new gear and abilities. Discover powerful synergies between dozens of unique items and build your way to fortune!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/mining.gif?t=1748111465\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Race with time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each day, you'll explore a randomly generated cave, trying to collect as much money as possible before time runs out. Anything you leave behind will be lost forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/bomb.gif?t=1748111465\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore multiple terrains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through diverse biomes, each filled with unique resources and obstacles that challenge your path to wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/DifferentBioms.png?t=1748111465\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Synergize your items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with countless item combinations to create powerful synergies. Plan your builds, develop strategies, and do whatever it takes to achieve success!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621320?t=1748111465","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621320?t=1748111465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/f1ddbdd81eb5b5553c3e9f4f819c1c1c61bf8dd4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748111465",