nergies. Plan your builds, develop strategies, and do whatever it takes to achieve success!</p>","developers":["Mateusz Pientka"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/c2dd0862c03368418f7e6d64b8835dfdff256330/header.jpg?t=1748111465","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129317,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129317/movie480.mp4?t=1745334292","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129317/movie_max.mp4?t=1745334292"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257129317/d9c67a97f6b322e17b78dabec1b3f881a51bd268/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745334292","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129317/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745334292","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129317/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745334292"}}],"name":"Oreflux","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5 or equvalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux"